WEBVTT

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:31.856
about this process of just
manufacturing romantic love,

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:34.736
but of course I was intrigued.

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:38.176
And when I got the chance
to try this study myself,

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:41.336
with someone I knew
but not particularly well,

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:44.496
I wasn't expecting to fall in love.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:47.216
But then we did, and --

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:49.136
(Laughter)

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:53.536
And I thought it made a good story,
so I sent it to the Modern Love column

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:55.376
a few months later.

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:59.120
Now, this was published in January,

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:01.576
and now it is August,